{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras/961f0d6d3a0d98823ba964f844fa25aa.avif?t=1774037641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras_big/961f0d6d3a0d98823ba964f844fa25aa.webp?t=1774037641 width=1560 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards, build decks, and battle fierce opponents in Top Check, a roguelike deckbuilder and card game inspired by the classic game of chess. Demonstrate your deck building prowess in the <strong>Roguelike Run</strong> game mode, or clash with adversaries <strong>online</strong> using your favorite constructed deck. With many unique pieces and abilities, only the best strategists will emerge victorious. Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras/54bf5864a6b26cd7c6fb9c5feb5394d2.poster.avif?t=1774037641\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras/54bf5864a6b26cd7c6fb9c5feb5394d2.webm?t=1774037641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras/54bf5864a6b26cd7c6fb9c5feb5394d2.mp4?t=1774037641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras/a3e10d07ec9ba413c54500fa32dd8d96.avif?t=1774037641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras_big/a3e10d07ec9ba413c54500fa32dd8d96.webp?t=1774037641 width=1560 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize powerful action cards to manipulate the state of the board to your advantage.\u00a0 Will you devise a strategy around copying important pieces?\u00a0 Or perhaps dominate the board using synergy between pieces of the same type.\u00a0 Whatever you choose, the possibilities are sure to captivate your inner strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras/dd3728a0683e8ea247db75c99779c9e9.avif?t=1774037641\" width=1560 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras/a89470de69191385946ca57546ff5266.avif?t=1774037641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/extras_big/a89470de69191385946ca57546ff5266.webp?t=1774037641 width=1560 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top Check has plenty of features to keep you engaged, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constructed deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial to guide you as a new player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1v1  AI Battle mode to test new decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated roguelike game mode with deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP with MMR-based matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of pieces and unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic options to personalize your in-game experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432200?t=1774037641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/edcf23dbce2044164f09bf4c44e901e06f854ce5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=17740376