 to test new decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated roguelike game mode with deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP with MMR-based matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of pieces and unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic options to personalize your in-game experience</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gliding Knight Games, LLC"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Microsoft Playfab (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/cb4ca09ed43d6df32695183086c583fc7ac5c532/header.jpg?t=1774037641","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3432200/2028851832/94231dfdd3e483b104c24985d53f4fbd671d3d9a/1767401134/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768242496","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3432200/2028851832/94231dfdd3e483b104c24985d53f4fbd671d3d9a/1767401134/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768242496","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3432200/2028851832/94231dfdd3e483b104c24985d53f4fbd671d3d9a/1767401134/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768242496","id":257099418,"name":"Top Check Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099418/6e43722c77f473ba3bcf2418f098f4d99a02a09d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768242496"}],"name":"Top Check","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><